empty: len 0 cap 16 finished true
one byte: len 1 finished true
capacity 0: cap 0 finished true, empty push cap 0, one push cap 16 finished true, first still true
bytes: len 2049 capacities 16 32 64 128 256 512 1024 2048 4096 finished true
strings: len 2100 capacities 16 32 64 128 256 512 1024 2048 4096 finished true
large: cap 100002 then 200004, len 100003 finished true
finish with room: first true second true third true
finish full: cap 3, empty push cap 3, byte push cap 16
finish full: first true again true terminated true second true self-append true
own storage: first true doubled true len 64 repeated true
join: none true one true gaps true no separator true many true
